.TH pdf-vdiff 1  "pdf-vdiff 0.1.0" 
.SH NAME
pdf\-vdiff \- Side\-by\-side visual PDF diffing tool preserving vector fidelity and searchability
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpdf\-vdiff\fR [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-open\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\fR] [\fB\-\-granularity\fR] [\fB\-\-gutter\-width\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-header\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-pages\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-generate\-completions\fR] [\fB\-\-generate\-man\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIBASE_PDF\fR] [\fITAILORED_PDF\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
A fast, standalone CLI tool that takes two PDF documents (e.g. base and tailored resumes) and produces a single side\-by\-side landscape PDF with IntelliJ/GitHub\-style visual diff highlighting.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Target output PDF file path [default: <base_stem>_vs_<tailored_stem>_diff.pdf]
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite destination output file if it already exists
.TP
\fB\-\-open\fR
Automatically open the generated diff in the system default PDF viewer
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\fR \fI<THEME>\fR [default: intellij]
Color palette theme (intellij, github, classic, high\-contrast)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
intellij: Soft IntelliJ\-style red/green diff colors (Default)
.IP \(bu 2
github: Clean GitHub\-style split diff colors
.IP \(bu 2
classic: Traditional vibrant red/green diff colors
.IP \(bu 2
high\-contrast: High\-contrast palette for maximum visual accessibility
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-granularity\fR \fI<GRANULARITY>\fR [default: word]
Diff granularity mode (word, line, character)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
word: Diff by word tokens (Default)
.IP \(bu 2
line: Diff by full lines
.IP \(bu 2
character: Diff by individual characters/glyphs
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-gutter\-width\fR \fI<GUTTER_WIDTH>\fR [default: 24]
Spacing in points between left and right pages
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-header\fR
Suppress the top header/metadata banner
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-pages\fR \fI<MAX_PAGES>\fR [default: 250]
Maximum page count threshold to prevent unbounded processing
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enable verbose structural logging (omits sensitive raw text PII)
.TP
\fB\-\-generate\-completions\fR \fI<SHELL>\fR
Generate shell completion script to stdout (bash, zsh, fish, elvish, powershell)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
bash
.IP \(bu 2
elvish
.IP \(bu 2
fish
.IP \(bu 2
powershell
.IP \(bu 2
zsh
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-generate\-man\fR
Generate roff man page (Section 1) to stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fIBASE_PDF\fR]
Path to the original / base PDF document
.TP
[\fITAILORED_PDF\fR]
Path to the modified / tailored PDF document
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
